		A New Clan has risen from Ultima Online and has joined the Timocracy of BoP. Their site is now under construction. Welcome Knights of Honor! (KoH) Marcus Anthony will be Clan High Lord and will gather his Following to swear in at the KoH Stone sometime soon. Marcus is a seasoned member that found his way home along with a few others. They decided that they wanted that "old time" Old Code" way of life. Well Marcus, you could not have chosen a better time. BoP is going through changes, not "old Code" wise but site and membership wise. Some members decided to move on elsewhere, but isn't this the way every guild goes?? It most certainly does at one time or another. But when a BoP member finally realizes what they want and do not have any longer, they come home sooner or later. Even after realizing members are or have moved on to other realms. This has even happened to me! Proud to have you back and a warm welcome to KoH members. May Honor Guide your Path! WTWYILAD!...CaScA 
